{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>He shall wash in water.</b> A priest or a Levite; therefore it was necessary to add the word \"the priest\" to \"and he shall offer.\"" "<b>A fire offering.</b> It is an adjective, meaning \"a fire offering,\" and it modifies the entire word." "<b>A pleasing [aroma].</b> Self-evident."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:08:21.643179458Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}